      },
      "ArticleTitle": "Vitamin D deficiency changes the intestinal microbiome reducing B vitamin production in the gut. The resulting lack of pantothenic acid adversely affects the immune system, producing a \"pro-inflammatory\" state associated with atherosclerosis and autoimmunity.",
